        {
            "title": "比特幣反彈至76,000美元，但13億美元ETF資金外流考驗復甦力道",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"比特幣在8.3萬美元附近整理，市場關注國債收益率攀升及美伊緊張局勢\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/d8f37829b8787b30ff9b429c84f7a86e829b0e3cc126531a493dcb28f087218d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fcontent-media.investing.com%2Fnews%2FLYNXNPED8B0RG_M.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">比特幣在8.3萬美元附近整理，市場關注國債收益率攀升及美伊緊張局勢</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><strong>Investing.com -</strong> 比特幣週六交易價格回升至76,000美元上方，顯示出在一輪劇烈拋售後市場趨於穩定，然而美國交易所交易基金（ETF）再度出現大規模資金撤離，凸顯出比特幣溫和反彈與機構需求之間仍存在明顯落差。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">截至美國東部時間凌晨3:13（北京時間15:13），全球最大加密貨幣比特幣上漲0.59%，報76,103.2美元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">根據基金資金流向數據，美國現貨比特幣ETF週五錄得淨流出4.119億美元，連續第二個交易日出現資金撤離。其中，貝萊德旗下iShares比特幣信託贖回金額達4.03億美元，部分被富達旗下基金流入的4,280萬美元所抵銷。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-60aa44b2-53be-3386-b112-4b7487871ab6-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">綜合最新數據，11月份截至週五，比特幣ETF淨流出規模已累計達約12.8億美元，本月迄今僅週三錄得單日淨流入。持續的資金外流表明，在比特幣大幅下跌後，機構投資者尚未提供穩定的支撐力量。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow hidden h-[94px] w-[300px] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:block\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">比特幣在週五早盤交易中24小時內跌幅一度達約5.2%，此前其跟隨美國期中選舉後的反彈行情已逐漸消退。科技股整體下跌——市場對人工智慧支出及數據中心發展前景的憂慮拖累了風險偏好。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">在此前24小時內，逾12.7億美元的加密貨幣衍生品倉位遭強制平倉，其中多頭押注被清算金額超過11億美元。強制平倉進一步放大了市場波動，交易者紛紛削減槓桿敞口。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">市場同時面臨更趨嚴格的監管環境。美國財政部官員採取行動，限制加密貨幣交易所MEXC進入美國金融體系，指控其在2021年至2026年間處理了至少160億美元與規避制裁及其他非法活動相關的可疑交易。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">另一方面，希臘批准了一項加密貨幣資本利得稅框架，規定超過每年500歐元門檻的收益須繳納10%稅率，並自2027年1月起對質押、借貸及去中心化金融收入徵收15%稅款。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">FTX崩潰引發的法律後續效應持續發酵，幣安（Binance）及其創辦人趙長鵬就一筆17.6億美元的追償糾紛，向投資人凱文·奧利里（Kevin O'Leary）及作家邁克爾·劉易斯（Michael Lewis）索取相關記錄。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">長期安全隱患亦再度引發關注。比特幣核心開發者科里·菲爾茲（Cory Fields）提出一項機制，要求潛在的量子攻擊者預先存入比特幣作為抵押，以便合法持有者可據此提出索賠。該提案目前仍處於概念階段，且需要具備抗量子能力的錢包配合實施。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">對於交易者而言，80,000美元是近期的關鍵反彈目標位，而73,000美元則被視為潛在下行支撐位。當前最直接的考驗，在於週六的反彈能否在ETF資金流向未見逆轉的情況下持續站穩。</p><h2 class=\"mb-module-gap leading-[1.35] text-px22 font-bold lg:text-px24 text-batcave\"><strong>今日加密貨幣行情：週六山寨幣走勢多數分化</strong></h2><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">根據最新市場快照，週六整體加密貨幣市場走勢分化。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">全球第二大加密貨幣<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"以太幣（Ether）\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:以太幣（Ether）;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/ethereum/eth-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">以太幣（Ether）</a>上漲0.95%，報2,247.99美元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">全球第三大加密貨幣<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"XRP\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:XRP;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/xrp/xrp-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">XRP</a>下跌0.82%，報1.1782美元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"Solana\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:Solana;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/solana/sol-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Solana</a>上漲0.71%，報90.220美元；<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"BNB\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:BNB;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/bnb/bnb-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">BNB</a>小幅上漲0.48%，報695.23美元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"卡爾達諾（Cardano）\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:卡爾達諾（Cardano）;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/cardano/ada-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">卡爾達諾（Cardano）</a>上漲0.65%，報0.1846美元；<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"狗狗幣（Dogecoin）\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:狗狗幣（Dogecoin）;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/dogecoin/doge-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">狗狗幣（Dogecoin）</a>則下跌0.31%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">迷因幣方面，<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"TRUMP\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:TRUMP;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/maga/trump-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">TRUMP</a>當日走勢持平，而<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"柴犬幣（Shiba Inu）\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:柴犬幣（Shiba Inu）;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/shiba-inu/shib-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">柴犬幣（Shiba Inu）</a>則下跌1.53%。</p></div>",
